# Cleansing in a three-player game: Bot1 pays for nothing, Bot2 chooses to pay 1 life for Bot3's Swamp, then concedes while
# Bot3 is asked. The payments are made only after every player has chosen (CR 101.4); a player who has left the game makes
# none (CR 800.4a), so nobody pays for the Swamp and it is destroyed with Bot1's Plains, while Bot2's Forest left the game
# with Bot2. Nobody's life changes.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cleansing
Plains
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Island x24
[Bot3 Deck]
Swamp
Island x24
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Cleansing.Cast
Bot1.Choose()
Bot2.Choose(Swamp)
Bot2.Concede
Bot3.Choose()
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot3.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Cleansing; Plains; Black Lotus
Bot3.Graveyard = Swamp
